{"id":"dolzhno","lemma":"должно","pos":"adv","rank":172,"glosses":["it must be, probably"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ab/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B6%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B6%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Почему должно быть иначе?","en":"Why should it be different?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283291","words":[{"g":"why"},null,{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Должно быть, та женщина - его жена.","en":"That woman must be his wife.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655885","words":[null,{"g":"to be"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"wife"}]},{"text":"Это должно быть сегодня?","en":"Does it have to be today?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"to be"},{"g":"today"}]},{"text":"Ты, должно быть, прав.","en":"You must be right.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Оно должно быть здесь.","en":"It's got to be here.","words":[{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to be"},{"g":"here"}]}]}